<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Pulse Privacy Policy</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for the Pulse app." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card: #111827;
      --card-2: #1e293b;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent: #3b82f6;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(59,130,246,0.18), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1220 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 20px 60px;
    }

    .topbar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 18px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .nav a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    .hero {
      background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.78);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(59,130,246,0.14);
      color: #93c5fd;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: white;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: white;
    }

    h3 {
      margin-top: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: white;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    ul {
      margin: 0 0 16px 20px;
      padding: 0;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .muted {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .contact-box {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 18px;
      background: var(--card-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    .contact-box a {
      color: #93c5fd;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      h1 {
        font-size: 30px;
      }

      .hero,
      .card {
        padding: 22px 18px;
      }

      .nav a {
        margin-left: 12px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="topbar">
      <a href="/" class="brand">Pulse</a>
      <div class="nav">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/support">Support</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">LEGAL</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Last updated: 15 March 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <p>
        Pulse ("we", "our", or "us") operates the Pulse mobile application.
        This Privacy Policy explains what information we may collect, how we use it,
        and the choices available to users.
      </p>

      <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
      <p>
        We may collect information you provide when creating an account, posting content,
        contacting support, or interacting with features in the app.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Account information such as username, display name, and profile details</li>
        <li>User-generated content such as videos, comments, captions, or other submissions</li>
        <li>Messages or information you send when requesting support</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Usage Data</h3>
      <p>
        We may collect limited technical and usage information about how the app is accessed and used.
        This may include device type, operating system, app version, and interaction data.
      </p>

      <h3>How We Use Information</h3>
      <p>We may use collected information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Operate, maintain, and improve the Pulse platform</li>
        <li>Provide core app functionality</li>
        <li>Moderate content and help maintain community safety</li>
        <li>Respond to support requests and user enquiries</li>
        <li>Monitor performance, reliability, and misuse of the service</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>User Content</h3>
      <p>
        Content posted by users may be visible to other users of the platform,
        depending on how the app is designed and the features being used.
      </p>

      <h3>Data Security</h3>
      <p>
        We take reasonable steps to protect information, but no method of transmission
        over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure.
      </p>

      <h3>Children</h3>
      <p>
        Pulse is not intended for children under 13. If you believe a child has provided
        personal information through the app, please contact us so we can review and address it.
      </p>

      <h3>Changes to This Policy</h3>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any updates will be posted on this page
        with a revised “Last updated” date.
      </p>

      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <div class="contact-box">
        <p class="muted">Questions about this policy?</p>
        <p><a href="mailto:support@pulse-app.global">support@pulse-app.global</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      © 2026 Pulse
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
